Package: macfeel
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Martin Preusse <mpreusse@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.12), python3-evdev, python3-pyudev, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0 (>= 4.14), gir1.2-adw-1 (>= 1.4), systemd, udev, adduser
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/mpreusse/macfeel
Description: Mac-like mouse acceleration for GNOME
 Makes an external mouse feel like on macOS, using a port of Apple's own
 pointer-acceleration algorithm. A small system service applies the curve
 below the compositor (Wayland and X11); a tray icon and a settings window
 with a live curve graph run in the desktop session.
